  "body": "## Problem\n\nCurrent category selection requires `role=button + exact accessible name` for every hierarchy level. Production logs show the first levels succeed, while leaf categories such as `Telefony komórkowe` and `Tablety` repeatedly time out even though Vinted renders them.\n\nThis breaks catalog scans across multiple bots and also Market Stats.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Keep the preferred exact accessible-button path.\n- Add a bounded fallback for Vinted leaf-category DOM variants.\n- Fallback requires:\n  - exact visible text,\n  - a known clickable ancestor,\n  - exactly one visible clickable exact match.\n- Similar/parent labels remain rejected; there is no substring/contains fallback.\n- Keep the original timeout budget instead of waiting another full timeout after the button lookup.\n- Add regression tests proving `Telefony komórkowe` does not match `Telefony komórkowe i komunikacja`, and `Tablety` does not match `Tablety i akcesoria`.\n\nThe change does not touch session persistence, login, real-action guards, quotas, or negotiation logic.",
